        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p>Effective Date: August 20, 2023</p>
        <p>Welcome to TikFinity, a website provided by <a href="https://zerody.one/">zerody.one</a> (&quot;we,&quot; &quot;us,&quot; &quot;our&quot;). At TikFinity, we are committed to protecting your privacy and ensuring the security of your personal information. This Data Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and safeguard your data when you visit our website <span id="domain">tikfinity.zerody.one</span>.</p>
        <p>By accessing or using TikFinity, you consent to the practices described in this policy. If you do not agree with this policy, please refrain from using our website.</p>
        <p><strong>1. Information We Collect</strong></p>
        <p>We collect the following types of data:</p>
        <p><strong>a. Personal Information:</strong> When you register for an account, log in via Google OAuth, or subscribe to our newsletter, we may collect your email address.</p>
        <p><strong>b. Server Access Logs:</strong> We automatically collect and store information in server access logs. This may include IP addresses, browser information, and timestamps.</p>
        <p><strong>c. TikTok Live Stream Data:</strong> If you specify your TikTok account, we may retrieve specific live stream data from your specified TikTok account. This includes data such as live chat messages, gift transactions, and usernames of live stream viewers during your live streams.</p>
        <p><strong>2. How We Use Your Information</strong></p>
        <p>We use your information for the following purposes:</p>
        <p><strong>a. Email Address:</strong> We use your email address to send you updates, newsletters, and other communications related to TikFinity. You can unsubscribe from these communications at any time by following the instructions in the emails.</p>
        <p><strong>b. Server Access Logs:</strong> We use server access logs for system administration, troubleshooting, and to analyze trends, such as identifying potential security threats.</p>
        <p><strong>c. TikTok Live Stream Data:</strong> We use TikTok live stream data that you specify for processing and analysis within TikFinity. This data may be used for generating insights, reports, or other features offered by TikFinity related to your live streams.</p>
        <p><strong>3. Google OAuth</strong></p>
        <p>When you log in to TikFinity using Google OAuth, we collect and use the following information from your Google account:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Your email address</li>
        </ul>
        <p>We use this information solely for the purpose of authenticating your identity and simplifying the login process. We do not access or store any other information from your Google account.</p>
        <p><strong>4. Data Security</strong></p>
        <p>We take the security of your data seriously. We implement reasonable and appropriate measures to protect your personal information from unauthorized access, disclosure, alteration, and destruction. However, no data transmission over the internet or storage method can be guaranteed to be 100% secure. While we strive to protect your data, we cannot guarantee its absolute security.</p>
        <p><strong>5. Disclosure of Your Information</strong></p>
        <p>We do not sell, trade, or rent your personal information to third parties. We may, however, share your information with:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>
                <p>Service Providers: We may share your data with trusted third-party service providers who assist us in operating our website or conducting our business.</p>
            </li>
            <li>
                <p>Legal Obligations: We may disclose your information if required to do so by law, in response to a court order, or in the good-faith belief that such action is necessary to comply with legal requirements.</p>
            </li>
        </ul>
        <p><strong>6. Your Choices and Rights</strong></p>
        <p>You have the following rights regarding your personal information:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>
                <p><strong>Access:</strong> You can request access to the personal information we hold about you.</p>
            </li>
            <li>
                <p><strong>Correction:</strong> You can request corrections to inaccurate or incomplete personal information.</p>
            </li>
            <li>
                <p><strong>Deletion:</strong> You can request the deletion of your personal information under certain circumstances.</p>
            </li>
        </ul>
        <p>To exercise these rights or to ask questions about your data, please contact us at support@tikfinity.com.</p>
        <p><strong>7. Changes to this Policy</strong></p>
        <p>We may update this Data Privacy Policy from time to time. We will notify you of any material changes by posting the updated policy on our website or by other means as required by applicable law. Your continued use of TikFinity after any changes indicates your acceptance of the updated policy.</p>
        <p><strong>8. Contact Us</strong></p>
        <p>If you have any questions or concerns about our Data Privacy Policy, please contact us via: support@tikfinity.com</p>
        <p>Thank you for choosing TikFinity. We appreciate your trust in us and are committed to protecting your privacy and data.</p>
